  "body": "When space, lifestyle, views and potential come together, you know you've found something special. This is the Bays family home you've been waiting for!  Priced significantly below the CV, these owners are motivated!\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 1,017m2 section, with multiple living areas, five bedrooms and two bathrooms, there's room for the whole family to spread out.  This is a home you can grow into, with plenty of potential to create something truly special.\r\n\r\nAnd the best bit? The pool is already done!  The stunning swimming pool creates an incredible setting for summer - think long afternoons in the water, kids and friends over, barbecues on the deck and weekends spent at home. It's the kind of outdoor lifestyle families dream about, and it's ready to enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nInside, it's all about space and potential. Ready for modernization, the home gives you the opportunity to update to your own taste, add value and create something that works perfectly for your family.  Positioned beautifully for the sun, natural light pours into the home throughout the day, bringing warmth to the living spaces and enhancing the relaxed indoor-outdoor lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe family-friendly location is hard to beat - just 100m to Murrays Bay School, so forget the school-run traffic and walk! You're also only 600m from Murrays Bay Beach and 1.5km from Mairangi Bay Village, plus in zone for Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nAt a Glance-\r\n* Five generous bedrooms & two bathrooms\r\n* Multiple living spaces\r\n* Generous 1,017m2 section\r\n* Double garaging & plenty of off-street parking\r\n* Exciting renovation and add-value potential\r\n* In zone for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Murrays Bay School\r\n* Sought-after Bays location\r\n\r\nAfter 18 years with the same owners, the opportunity is now yours. Bring your ideas, create your vision and make this much-loved family home your own.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this much space, lifestyle and potential in the Bays are very hard to find.  Act now and secure your future!\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34933\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:  Some of the interior photographs are digitally staged.",
